<title>USA: Cincinnati Bell unit buys Florida company.</title>
<headline>Cincinnati Bell unit buys Florida company.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>MATRIXX Marketing Inc, a subsidiary of Cincinnati Bell Inc, said on Friday that it will buy Software Support Inc of Heathrow, Florida, for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The company gives technical help with computers over the telephone to clients that include original equipment makers, corporations and small offices. It had about $20 million in its 1996 revenues, MATRIXX said.</p>
<p>MATRIXX provides telephone marketing for various industries. It has more than 13,300 employees worldwide and said its 1996 revenues were $320 million.</p>
</text>
